        "Capacity/deletion/export actions: three captures appended, fourth showed a capacity error and preserved all entries/live state, deleting the middle retained remaining IDs/order/values, and recapture produced a distinct ID. Export matched order and actual stable IDs ember, verdant, azure with only contract fields. Imported two-entry list round-tripped stable IDs, fractional speeds 1.5 and 0.375, null overview selection, and Ember tracking. Extra keys/angles were ignored. Null restore cleared selection/info/highlight and disabled tracking. Valid and empty imports changed only the list in paused and playing states; playback progression was accounted for rather than mistaken for mutation.",
